A||N||13||2xsess||I miss my Fiero...and my life||||9||
Z||000000||2xsess||06-17-2001||04:47 PM||||well, it's been a month, and I have to say, it's been a cool experience being here in Kosovo but I miss my car and all the usual things I do with my life, like buy Fiero parts, fix my fiero, play with my dogs, work on the fiero some more. Well, you all know the ritual. <P>I admit, I've seen a country that other wise I would have never seen in my life, I've meet people from all around the world, including Italy,Spain,Germany,Sweden, and even soldiers from Cliff's homeland. All in all I'd have to say that this is an experience I will never forget but I won't ever want to repeat. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I hope you all are doing well!<P>Take care,<BR>Jeff<P>||||reg||9
Z||000001||88CoupeV6||06-17-2001||05:16 PM||||Nice to here from you. Glad you are doing ok. When do you come back home? <P>------------------<BR>Josh <B>(known by TheFiero64 for first 1239 posts)</B><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">    <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||7
Z||000002||FieroJoe||06-17-2001||10:31 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 2xsess:<BR><B>well, it's been a month<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>5 more to go, right?<P>Look on the bright side, what if you couldnt get on the internet, and had to stay away from the Forum for so long??  I think that I would go crazy if I didn't have my car <I>and</I> couldnt get on the forum.  At least you can get your Fiero drug here and live the Fiero life vicariously.<P>Stay safe over there!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
