Z||000006||beachbomb||06-18-2001||03:17 PM||||Hey, just think of all that HIGH PAY you get while you're away from you're family, friends, cars, hobbies and everything else!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> Take care and can't wait for you to get back..Jim(2 '84 Indys)<BR>Fellow military friend!!!!<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000007||2xsess||06-18-2001||03:33 PM||||High Pay?...I'm only an E-4, high pay is a foreign phrase to me my friend,lol.<P>Actually, I don't get to really read the forum, every once in a while I get to browse through and briefly read some topics.<P>Josh, what's with the name change?<P>I'm supposed to get home around the end of November, like the very end. And my wife is due the end of December, I'll have about a month to totally accept the fact that I'm going to be a father and readjust to living in civilization again.<P>Take care,<BR>Jeff||||reg||10
Z||000008||88CoupeV6||06-18-2001||04:56 PM||||I thought it described my car better. Everyone at Carlisle was asking me why I used TheFiero64. I told them that when I was on aol I tried using Fiero but it was taken and it suggested fiero64 then on Pennocks Fiero64 was taken so I added "The". Now 88Coupev6 fits me better. Everyone thinks I was born in 64 until they see how young I am, born in 78.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Josh <B>(known by TheFiero64 for first 1239 posts)</B><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">    <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||7
