Z||000011||turbo86se||06-19-2001||11:29 AM||||LOL BroCar, I crack up everytime I see that pic! I thought you gave up on Fieros?<P>Jeff, great news! The myth of the V6 coupe is a reality! It's sitting in my driveway right now, and I've been driving it nearly everyday for the past month! I even drove it to Carlisle! I didn't meet too many Forum members though, but the ones I did meet were top notch, and I appreciate it!<P>I also drove my SE for the first time in a month last night (she's been sleeping in the garage), and all I can say is what a difference! I really need new shocks/struts on the '88. I really appreciate the KONI's on the 86 now. Compared to the '86SE, the '88 V6 is LOUD! <BR>My mechanic moved down to Key West. Now it's just me and the great people on the Forum working on my Fieros. He did leave me a present, as soon as I get a pic of it I'll post it!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=226077&a=1676320&p=20236791"> ||||reg||1
